# MSMCP worked-example query: a single SYNTHETIC MS2 spectrum for demonstration.
# See "Try it in 60 seconds" in README.md.  Its peaks duplicate the Caffeine
# record in examples/caffeine_library.msp, so searching it there gives a
# deterministic top hit (score 1.0).  This is fabricated demonstration data, not
# a measured spectrum and not a compound identification.
BEGIN IONS
TITLE=Caffeine_demo_MS2
PEPMASS=195.0877
MSLEVEL=2
RTINSECONDS=132.0
110.0713 40.0
120.0808 100.0
136.0757 60.0
138.0662 420.0
END IONS
